@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceIncidentId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health/readiness
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Working list flow
GET {{host}}/api/incidents
Accept: application/json

### Filtered list
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Empty but correct result: expected 200 with []
### No incident has status Resolved in the baseline seed.
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Resolved
Accept: application/json

### Existing details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceIncidentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing resource: expected 404 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Accept: application/json

### Invalid filter: expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json

### Lab 1 extension point: implemented in ЛР 1.
### Expected 200 with all four severity levels in criticality order
### (Low, Medium, High, Critical). On the baseline seed:
### Low: 1, Medium: 1, High: 1, Critical: 0.
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary
Accept: application/json

### Summary with optional status filter: expected 200.
### On the baseline seed only Triaged incident is Medium,
### so expected Low: 0, Medium: 1, High: 0, Critical: 0.
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Summary with a status that is not on the allowlist:
### expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json
